<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat September subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to September totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    960,974  (565,759)  6,090,793  (4,709,071)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts     90,652  (135,837)  1,528,770  (1,571,350)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	 6,187   (42,223)    170,269    (215,692)</p>
<p> Linseed expls     7,501    (7,061)    104,544     (85,112)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    9,951   (10,687)     35,344     (35,183)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   20,449   (12,014)    150,057    (162,208)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     139,399  (160,091)  1,139,599  (1,021,851)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	   785     (95,199) 1,030,601   (1,087,580)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in September were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 107,386; Malaysia 78,469; Denmark 84,031; Holland 103,272</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 52,740; Denmark 4,917; U.K. 26,252</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
